   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to develop PATH&apos;s Equitable Innovations Platform (EquIP) portfolio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PATH&#x2019;s EquIP maternal health portfolio brings together innovative, science-driven solutions to protect women and newborns during pregnancy, childbirth, and the postpartum period. The portfolio includes three distinct initiatives&#x2014;CArE, ADePt, and eXPERT&#x2014;designed to strengthen science-driven innovation, equitable access, and life-saving solutions for mothers and their children.</narrative>
  </description>
